[break] state-project-file-keyed-by-name-alone
rule: An extension's `project` values are kept in a file named for where it comes from and its name.
file: crates/cineris-core/src/ext/state.rs
in: Owner::file_name
find: Ok(format!("{}-{}.json", self.source.as_str(), self.name))
replace: Ok(format!("{}.json", self.name))
caught-by:
    cineris-core::it ext_state::the_users_and_the_projects_extension_of_one_name_never_see_each_others_values
    cineris-core ext::state::tests::an_extensions_values_are_keyed_by_where_it_comes_from_and_its_name

[break] state-a-name-that-is-not-one-file-name-is-taken
rule: A name that is not one plain file name keeps no `project` values.
file: crates/cineris-core/src/ext/state.rs
