[break] state-a-call-is-served-the-users-values
rule: A call is served the values of the extension that made it, by its source: a project's extension is never served the user's.
file: crates/cineris-core/src/ext/tools.rs
in: LoadedExtension::call_tool
find: source: self.approved.source
replace: source: cineris_ext::source::Source::User
caught-by:
    cineris-core::it ext_state::the_users_and_the_projects_extension_of_one_name_never_see_each_others_values

# ------------------------------------------------- the session's values

[break] state-session-values-not-read-back
