    cineris-core ext::state::tests::a_set_that_changes_nothing_writes_nothing
    cineris-core::it ext_state::a_session_value_is_read_back_in_the_session_and_a_set_to_null_removes_it

[break] state-removal-read-back-as-null
rule: A record that removes a key is read back as a removal, not as a `null` value.
file: crates/cineris-core/src/ext/state.rs
