    cineris-core::it ext_state::a_project_file_this_build_did_not_write_is_refused_and_left_as_it_is

[break] state-refused-file-read-as-empty
rule: A project's file that is refused is not read as empty and written over: the call is refused, and the file is left as it is.
file: crates/cineris-core/src/ext/state.rs
in: read_file
find: parse_file(&bytes).map_err(refused)
replace: Ok(parse_file(&bytes).unwrap_or_default())
caught-by:
    cineris-core::it ext_state::a_project_file_this_build_did_not_write_is_refused_and_left_as_it_is

[break] state-project-file-not-owner-only
rule: A project's file is written owner-only.
file: crates/cineris-core/src/ext/state.rs
in: ExtState::project_set
find: owner_only: true
replace: owner_only: false
os: linux
caught-by:
    cineris-core::it ext_state::a_project_file_is_written_owner_only

# ------------------------------------------------------------------ caps

