[break] state-session-records-one-byte-past-their-budget
rule: At the budget of an extension's `session` records a set is kept, and one byte past it a set is refused.
file: crates/cineris-core/src/ext/state.rs
in: within_budget
find: if would_be > budget {
replace: if would_be > budget + 1 {
