    cineris-core::it ext_state::a_sessions_records_are_held_to_their_budget_at_its_edge_and_after_a_resume

[break] state-session-records-counted-without-their-line
rule: A `session` record counts its `ext` and `data` and an allowance for the rest of its line, not its `ext` and `data` alone.
